{
  "title": "【相談】旦那が毎朝スリッパを玄関に並べるんだけど",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">\n<div class=\"neko-res-list\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">1：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:08:11 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">最近、旦那が毎朝スリッパを玄関に並べて出勤する。<br>しかも二足ともつま先をドアに向けてる。<br>何か意味があるのかな。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:11:28 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">スリッパも出勤するんじゃない</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">3：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:15:45 ID:C3pL9sW6</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">二足って旦那さんと奥様の？</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">4：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:20:02 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res3\">&gt;&gt;3</a><br>そう。私のピンクと旦那の紺。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">5：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:26:19 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">夫婦そろって出荷待ち</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">6：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:33:36 ID:D6vN2kR8</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">単に玄関を片付けてるだけでは</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">7：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:35:53 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">でも昨日はスリッパの間に10円玉が置いてあった。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">8：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:38:10 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">通行料ｗ</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">9：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:42:27 ID:C3pL9sW6</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">10円玉は毎日？</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:47:44 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res9\">&gt;&gt;9</a><br>昨日だけ。今朝はなかった。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">11：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 09:53:01 ID:E9hQ5tM3</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">まず旦那さんに聞けばいいのに</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">12：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:00:18 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">聞いたら『今は言えない』って。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">13：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:02:35 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">スリッパの国家機密</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">14：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:05:52 ID:D6vN2kR8</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">何かの準備かな。来客予定とか</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">15：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:09:09 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">来客の予定はない。<br>旦那はいつも通り弁当持って会社行った。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">16：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:14:26 ID:C3pL9sW6</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">並べ方はきれい？</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">17：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:20:43 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">ものすごくきれい。かかとの位置がぴったり。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">18：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:27:00 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">スリッパ整列！</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">19：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:29:17 ID:E9hQ5tM3</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">その10円玉はどうしたの</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">20：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:32:34 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">財布に入れた。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">21：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:36:51 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">証拠品を使うなｗ</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">22：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:41:08 ID:D6vN2kR8</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">玄関に小銭を置く習慣でもあるのかね</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">23：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:47:25 ID:C3pL9sW6</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">旦那さん、最近何か新しい趣味始めた？</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">24：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:54:42 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">先週から新聞の折り込みをよく見てる。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">25：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:56:59 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">スリッパとチラシの関連が読めない</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">26：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 10:59:16 ID:D6vN2kR8</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">玄関マットとか家具の広告じゃない？</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">27：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:03:33 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">昨日はホームセンターのチラシを見てた。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">28：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:08:50 ID:C3pL9sW6</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">新しい靴箱が欲しいとか</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">29：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:14:07 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">靴箱は先月買ったばかり。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:21:24 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">玄関に投資しすぎ</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:23:41 ID:E9hQ5tM3</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">10円玉の件が妙に気になる</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:26:58 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">私も。<br>しかも旦那のスリッパの方に近かった。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:30:15 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">旦那側の資産</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:35:32 ID:D6vN2kR8</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">奥様も試しに位置を変えてみたら？</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">35：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:41:49 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res34\">&gt;&gt;34</a><br>やってみる。今夜、旦那が帰る前に。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">36：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:48:06 ID:C3pL9sW6</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">何時ごろ帰宅？</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">37：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:50:23 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">普段は7時半くらい。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">38：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:53:40 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">スリッパ捜査班、夜まで待機</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">39：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 11:57:57 ID:E9hQ5tM3</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">いたずらして怒られない程度にね</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res40\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">40：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 12:02:14 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">じゃあ私のピンクを少し前に出しておく。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res41\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">41：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 12:08:31 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">妻が一歩リード</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res42\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">42：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 12:15:48 ID:D6vN2kR8</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">そんなに深刻に考えることでもないと思うｗ</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res43\" style=\