ne-height:1.45!important\">47：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:35:13 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">帰ってきた。<br>玄関で立ち止まってスリッパを見てた。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res48\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">48：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:42:30 ID:B8rT4nX2</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">気づいたｗ</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res49\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">49：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">1</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:44:47 ID:A7mK2qP9</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">私のピンクを元の位置に戻した。<br>それから小声で『まだ早い』って。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res50\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">50：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:47:04 ID:C3pL9sW6</div>\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">何が早いんだよ</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res51\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\">\n<div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">51：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</